      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LAST CLANSMAN (3) was in the money at this track two runs ago before having his colours lowered at his latest appearance over 2300m at this track, beaten 16 metres. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. Won't find this any harder and he can finish a lot closer this time. LOTUS LOUISE (8) has been racing well of late. Finished fourth at his latest appearance over 2300m at this track, beaten 9 metres. Must overcome a very wide draw. Leading hope based on those recent efforts. AFFAIRE DE COVER (4) was in the money two starts ago then things went wrong last start when he broke and finished a long last over 1609m at this track. This doesn't look as hard so he is capable of turning things around. ITZFERGIETIME (7) is in the mix following a respectable second at her most recent appearance over 2300m at this track.",
